WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.667
Mr. Gwarg blew his whistle.

2
00:00:04.668 --> 00:00:11.359
"The second heat in the sack race starts in one minute. Racers, to your places!"

3
00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:15.982
Zork, Lon, and Cleo hurried to the starting line.

4
00:00:15.983 --> 00:00:22.102
Ben, Deb, and Jen climbed into their sacks and lined up alongside them.

5
00:00:22.103 --> 00:00:28.116
Tweet! As the race began, Ben took off, hopping as fast as he could.

6
00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:32.167
Deb was right behind him, hopping almost as fast.

7
00:00:32.168 --> 00:00:36.215
Meanwhile Jen was bouncing her way across the field.

8
00:00:36.216 --> 00:00:43.668
She tried to go fast, but she kept bouncing too high, and soon she was way behind the others.

9
00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:46.851
Team Orange had taken off fast too.

10
00:00:46.852 --> 00:00:50.323
But as Cleo hopped, her wrappings unraveled.

11
00:00:50.324 --> 00:00:54.360
She hopped face-first to the ground. "Ouch!"

12
00:00:54.361 --> 00:00:59.662
Zork had shot ahead of Ben, and Lon was hopping even faster than Zork.

13
00:00:59.663 --> 00:01:07.984
Suddenly the werewolf howled, and he accidentally dropped to all fours.

14
00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:16.627
Mr. Gwarg blew his whistle. "Lon! That's not hopping! You're disqualified!"

15
00:01:16.628 --> 00:01:21.159
Lon growled and slunk off the field.

16
00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:26.159
That left Zork in the lead, with Ben and Deb close behind.

17
00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:29.213
Off to the right, Ben spotted Winnie.

18
00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:34.701
She and Serena were watching the race and cheering with all the other spectators.

19
00:01:34.702 --> 00:01:41.456
"Huh?" he thought. "Why is Winnie watching Zork instead of me?"

20
00:01:41.457 --> 00:01:45.181
"Ben!" A sharp voice cut into his thoughts.

21
00:01:45.182 --> 00:01:50.759
"You're out too!" Mr. Gwarg called. "No floating!"

22
00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.116
"Ugh." Ben groaned.

23
00:01:53.117 --> 00:01:56.376
He'd lost his focus and started floating.

24
00:01:56.377 --> 00:01:59.076
He flew over to the sideline.

25
00:01:59.077 --> 00:02:04.353
Now the race was between Deb and Zork—and Zork was ahead.

26
00:02:04.354 --> 00:02:08.392
"Feet, do your stuff!" Deb said.

27
00:02:08.393 --> 00:02:14.565
Sproing! Sproing! Sproing! Suddenly Deb bounced like a spring across the field.

28
00:02:14.566 --> 00:02:18.386
But unlike Jen, she could control her bounces.

29
00:02:18.387 --> 00:02:23.428
And with three more tremendous hops, she sailed over the finish line.

30
00:02:23.429 --> 00:02:27.710
"Team Black!" Mr. Gwarg announced.

31
00:02:27.711 --> 00:02:31.146
"Argh!" Zork cried angrily.

32
00:02:31.147 --> 00:02:34.442
Deb grinned as she dropped her sack.

33
00:02:34.443 --> 00:02:41.461
Ben laughed—Deb had kangaroo feet, just like Carly!

34
00:02:41.462 --> 00:02:45.237
"Thanks for the idea, Carly!" she called sweetly.

35
00:02:45.238 --> 00:02:50.306
"Grr . . ." Carly looked furious.

36
00:02:50.307 --> 00:02:53.322
Mr. Gwarg glanced at his clipboard.

37
00:02:53.323 --> 00:03:00.434
"Our top four winners are Mog and Deb for Team Black and Carly and Zork for Team Orange.

38
00:03:00.435 --> 00:03:05.287
We'll have one more race to determine the winner of the sack race."

39
00:03:05.288 --> 00:03:13.649
Mr. Freaky did a little dance. "I love Field Day!"

40
00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:18.219
"I'm ready to kick some lizard tail," Mog muttered to Ben.

41
00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:21.667
"And I know Zork's secret weakness."

42
00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:24.076
"Go for it, Mog," Ben said.

43
00:03:24.077 --> 00:03:30.331
Mog hurried off to take his place at the starting line alongside Deb, Carly, and Zork. Just

44
00:03:30.332 --> 00:03:35.795
before the race started, Ben saw Mog whisper something to Zork. The

45
00:03:35.796 --> 00:03:41.908
whistle blew, and both Deb and Carly sprang off the line with their kangaroo feet. Then—

46
00:03:41.909 --> 00:03:48.598
crash! They accidentally smashed into each other in the air and fell to the ground.

47
00:03:48.599 --> 00:03:53.248
Mog, hopping like mad, passed the toppled doppelgangers.

48
00:03:53.249 --> 00:03:58.362
Zork hopped along too. "He looks nervous," Ben thought.

49
00:03:58.363 --> 00:04:02.642
Zork's tail kept thrashing around inside the sack.

50
00:04:02.643 --> 00:04:07.226
"Ahh!" Zork suddenly tumbled flat onto his back.

51
00:04:07.227 --> 00:04:11.052
Mog smiled with glee as he glanced backward.

52
00:04:11.053 --> 00:04:17.750
Ben saw that Deb was on her feet again, springing after him, with Carly right behind her.

53
00:04:17.751 --> 00:04:22.949
Mog surged toward the finish line. "He's going to win!" Ben cried.

54
00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:28.496
But then, with a loud ripping sound, the bottom tore out of Mog's sack.

55
00:04:28.497 --> 00:04:34.917
"Huh?" Mog yelped in surprise as he sprawled forward several feet from the finish line.

56
00:04:34.918 --> 00:04:39.704
Zork saw him fall and laughed loudly.

57
00:04:39.705 --> 00:04:46.194
But somehow Deb had missed it, and she tripped over Mog.

58
00:04:46.195 --> 00:04:54.091
"Yahoo!" Carly shrieked as she leaped across the finish line. "I did it! I won!"

59
00:04:54.092 --> 00:04:58.405
"Another point for Team Orange!" Mr. Gwarg announced.

60
00:04:58.406 --> 00:05:06.633
"They're in the lead, two to zero."

61
00:05:06.634 --> 00:05:11.174
Team Black stood together on the field, shaking their heads.

62
00:05:11.175 --> 00:05:15.879
"Sorry, everybody," Deb said. "I totally blew it."

63
00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:24.018
Mog growled with frustration. "I was about to win—until my sack ripped."

64
00:05:24.019 --> 00:05:28.531
"Hmm." Waldo pushed his glasses up on his nose.

65
00:05:28.532 --> 00:05:31.173
"First the rope breaks when we're winning.

66
00:05:31.174 --> 00:05:34.902
Then Mog's sack mysteriously rips.

67
00:05:34.903 --> 00:05:37.930
It's like Team Black is cursed or something."

68
00:05:37.931 --> 00:05:43.142
Pixel looked at Waldo. "You haven't been using magic, have you?"

69
00:05:43.143 --> 00:05:46.305
Ben had been wondering the exact same thing.

70
00:05:46.306 --> 00:05:49.189
Waldo's spells often went haywire.

71
00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:53.514
Maybe that was why Team Black was having such rotten luck today.

72
00:05:53.515 --> 00:05:56.077
"Of course not!" Waldo replied.

73
00:05:56.078 --> 00:05:59.883
"We'd be disqualified if I got caught using magic."

74
00:05:59.884 --> 00:06:05.141
Mog bit his lip. "I don't know what's going on, but I do know this.

75
00:06:05.142 --> 00:06:11.102
We have to win the next two challenges—and come in second in the cross-country race.

76
00:06:11.103 --> 00:06:15.693
If we don't, Team Orange is going to win the whole thing."

77
00:06:15.694 --> 00:06:18.944
"Ugh," Ben said, looking toward Zork.

78
00:06:18.945 --> 00:06:20.446
"That would be awful."

79
00:06:20.447 --> 00:06:27.221
Right now the captain of Team Orange was strutting up and down the field, pumping up the crowd.

80
00:06:27.222 --> 00:06:33.637
And even worse, Winnie and Serena were watching his every move.

